WEBVTT

00:02:59.451 --> 00:03:04.361
13 yildan so'ng Vilgelm Rentgen rentgen
nurlarini aniqlagach, shifokorlarda

00:03:04.361 --> 00:03:09.659
kasallikni tashxislash va uning rivojlani-
shini kuzatish imkoni paydo bo'ldi.

00:03:09.659 --> 00:03:14.453
Ushbu kashfiyotlar olimlarga ishonchli va 
samarali vaksinalarni yaratishga

00:03:14.453 --> 00:03:18.035
imkon berdi: dastlab, 
chechakka qarshi, 1921-yilda esa

00:03:18.035 --> 00:03:23.375
virusologlar BSJ – silga qarshi 
vaksinani ishlab chiqdilar.

00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:27.906
Bu ilmiy topilmalar hozirda silni 
davolashning eng samarali ususli bo'lgan

00:03:27.906 --> 00:03:31.025
zamonaviy antibiotiklarga 
asos bo'lib xizmat qildi.